{"seq":2,"slug":"6d-pose-estimation","title":"6D 物体位姿估计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/perception-pose/6d-pose-estimation","wordCount":1555,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"6d-物体位姿估计\">6D 物体位姿估计</h1><p>知道一个物体&quot;在哪、朝哪&quot;——三维位置加三维朝向，合称 6D 位姿——是模型已知抓取的关键一步。有了 6D 位姿，机器人就能把预先在物体坐标系标注好的抓取点变换到世界坐标系，直接交给<a href=\"../planning-control/kinematics-ik\">运动学与逆运动学</a>求解关节角。本篇承接<a href=\"rgbd-pointcloud\">RGB-D 与点云处理</a>的点云输入，讲清从传统配准到 2025 年基础模型驱动的 6D 位姿估计全谱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>6D 位姿估计要输出物体相对相机的旋转 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\in SO(3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和平移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{t} \\in \\mathbb{R}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9372em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8981em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。方法按&quot;是否需要物体的 CAD 模型&quot;和&quot;是否需要为该物体专门训练&quot;分为四象限：实例级（已知特定物体）、类别级（已知类别不知具体实例）、CAD 引导（推理时给模型）、零样本（无需任何该物体训练）。2024–2026 年的趋势是基础模型把零样本能力推到实用门槛。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[6D 位姿估计] --&gt; B[实例级&lt;br/&gt;已知特定物体]&#10;    A --&gt; C[类别级&lt;br/&gt;已知类别]&#10;    A --&gt; D[CAD引导&lt;br/&gt;推理时给模型]&#10;    A --&gt; E[零样本&lt;br/&gt;无需该物体训练]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[PoseCNN / PVNet&lt;br/&gt;需逐物体训练]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[NOCS&lt;br/&gt;归一化坐标空间]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[FoundationPose&lt;br/&gt;给CAD即可]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[SAM-6D / FreePose&lt;br/&gt;分割+特征匹配]\">flowchart TD\n    A[6D 位姿估计] --&gt; B[实例级&lt;br/&gt;已知特定物体]\n    A --&gt; C[类别级&lt;br/&gt;已知类别]\n    A --&gt; D[CAD引导&lt;br/&gt;推理时给模型]\n    A --&gt; E[零样本&lt;br/&gt;无需该物体训练]\n    B --&gt; B1[PoseCNN / PVNet&lt;br/&gt;需逐物体训练]\n    C --&gt; C1[NOCS&lt;br/&gt;归一化坐标空间]\n    D --&gt; D1[FoundationPose&lt;br/&gt;给CAD即可]\n    E --&gt; E1[SAM-6D / FreePose&lt;br/&gt;分割+特征匹配]</pre><p>下表对比四类方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>是否需 CAD</th>\n<th>是否需逐物体训练</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实例级</td>\n<td>否（学进权重）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>PoseCNN、PVNet</td>\n<td>固定产线已知零件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类别级</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否（同类即可）</td>\n<td>NOCS</td>\n<td>同类多实例（各种杯子）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CAD 引导</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>FoundationPose</td>\n<td>新物体有模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零样本</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>SAM-6D、FreePose</td>\n<td>全新未知物体</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"传统配准与对应点方法\">传统配准与对应点方法</h2><p>承接<a href=\"rgbd-pointcloud\">RGB-D 与点云处理</a>末尾的配准流水线，经典 6D 位姿估计在已知 CAD 模型时走&quot;特征对应 + 求解&quot;路线。先在模型和观测点云上提取局部几何特征（如 FPFH），建立 3D-3D 对应，用 RANSAC 剔除错配得到粗位姿，再用 ICP 精修。求解刚体变换是一个带正交约束的最小二乘问题，经典闭式解由 SVD 给出：对去中心化点对的协方差矩阵做奇异值分解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H = U\\Sigma V^\\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则最优旋转为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center center center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><msup><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><msup><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = V \\begin{bmatrix} 1 &amp; &amp; \\\\ &amp; 1 &amp; \\\\ &amp; &amp; \\det(VU^\\top) \\end{bmatrix} U^\\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.6091em;vertical-align:-1.5546em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.667em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.667em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 667 3600\"><path d=\"M403 1759 V84 H666 V0 H319 V1759 v0 v1759 h347 v-84\nH403z M403 1759 V0 H319 V1759 v0 v1759 h84z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0546em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.2146em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0146em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8054em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5546em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0546em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.2146em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0146em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8054em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5546em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0546em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.2146em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0146em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8054em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">det</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5546em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.667em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.667em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 667 3600\"><path d=\"M347 1759 V0 H0 V84 H263 V1759 v0 v1759 H0 v84 H347z\nM347 1759 V0 H263 V1759 v0 v1759 h84z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>末项的行列式修正防止解退化为镜像反射。传统方法精度高、可解释，但要求纹理或几何特征丰富、遮挡少；对称物体（如圆柱、球）会因位姿歧义而失败——这是后续学习方法专门处理的难点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"深度学习的实例级与类别级方法\">深度学习的实例级与类别级方法</h2><p>深度学习把位姿估计转为端到端预测。<strong>PoseCNN</strong> 直接回归物体中心和旋转四元数；<strong>PVNet</strong> 改为预测关键点的像素级投票方向，再用 PnP（Perspective-n-Point）从 2D-3D 对应解位姿，对遮挡更鲁棒。这些是实例级方法——每个物体要单独训练，适合产线固定 SKU。</p>\n<p>类别级方法突破&quot;逐物体训练&quot;的限制。**NOCS（Normalized Object Coordinate Space）**把同类物体归一化到一个共享的标准坐标立方体，网络预测每个像素在这个标准空间中的坐标，再与观测点云对齐求位姿与尺寸。这样训练一次就能处理&quot;任意杯子&quot;，而不只是某个特定杯子。对称物体的歧义则用&quot;对称感知损失&quot;处理——只惩罚到最近等价位姿的误差，避免网络在等价朝向间反复横跳。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基础模型驱动的零样本位姿\">基础模型驱动的零样本位姿</h2><p>2024 年起，基础模型把 6D 位姿推向零样本。<strong>FoundationPose</strong>（NVIDIA）统一了&quot;给 CAD 模型&quot;和&quot;给少量参考图&quot;两种设置，通过大规模合成数据训练，对全新物体无需微调即可估计并持续跟踪 6-DoF 位姿，已成为 2025 年广泛使用的基线，常配合固定标定的俯视相机做连续位姿跟踪。</p>\n<p>零样本无 CAD 路线则组合分割基础模型与特征匹配。<strong>SAM-6D</strong> 用 SAM 分割出目标，再做模板匹配与点云配准，在未见物体上超过 FoundationPose 的零样本表现，刷新 RGB-D 零样本基准。<strong>FreePose</strong>（2025）用 SAM2 分割目标、提取视觉特征建立 3D-3D 对应、用 TEASER 鲁棒配准算法求位姿，在 UR3 机器人真实抓取实验中取得 65.0% 的成功率。另一条线 <strong>ActivePose</strong>（2025）引入主动视觉——在抓取中主动选择能消除位姿歧义的视角，配合扩散策略，把成功率推到 90%。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>年份</th>\n<th>设置</th>\n<th>关键技术</th>\n<th>标志性结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FoundationPose</td>\n<td>2024</td>\n<td>CAD 或参考图，零样本</td>\n<td>大规模合成训练、统一框架</td>\n<td>跨设置 SOTA 跟踪基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SAM-6D</td>\n<td>2024</td>\n<td>零样本无 CAD</td>\n<td>SAM 分割 + 模板匹配</td>\n<td>超越 FoundationPose 零样本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FreePose</td>\n<td>2025</td>\n<td>零样本无 CAD</td>\n<td>SAM2 + TEASER 配准</td>\n<td>UR3 抓取成功率 65%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ActivePose</td>\n<td>2025</td>\n<td>主动视觉 + 扩散策略</td>\n<td>选歧义消除视角</td>\n<td>抓取成功率 90%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"位姿估计在抓取管线中的角色\">位姿估计在抓取管线中的角色</h2><p>6D 位姿估计是&quot;模型已知&quot;抓取范式的核心：物体模型上预标注的抓取点经位姿变换落到世界坐标，再求逆运动学执行。它与下一篇的<a href=\"grasp-detection-networks\">抓取检测网络</a>构成两条互补路线——位姿估计适合已知物体、需要精确放置（如装配插孔），抓取检测适合未知物体、只需稳稳拿起。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[RGB-D 点云&lt;br/&gt;来自上一篇] --&gt; B[6D 位姿估计]&#10;    B --&gt; C[物体坐标系下预标注抓取点]&#10;    C --&gt; D[位姿变换到世界坐标]&#10;    D --&gt; E[逆运动学求关节角]&#10;    E --&gt; F[执行抓取与精确放置]&#10;    B -.对比路线.-&gt; G[抓取检测网络&lt;br/&gt;未知物体直接出抓取]\">flowchart TD\n    A[RGB-D 点云&lt;br/&gt;来自上一篇] --&gt; B[6D 位姿估计]\n    B --&gt; C[物体坐标系下预标注抓取点]\n    C --&gt; D[位姿变换到世界坐标]\n    D --&gt; E[逆运动学求关节角]\n    E --&gt; F[执行抓取与精确放置]\n    B -.对比路线.-&gt; G[抓取检测网络&lt;br/&gt;未知物体直接出抓取]</pre><p>位姿误差会等量传导到抓取落点，因此实战中常用 ActivePose 式的主动视觉或多帧融合压缩误差。对装配、插拔这类对放置精度敏感的任务，6D 位姿估计仍不可替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>6D 位姿 = 旋转 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\in SO(3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> + 平移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8981em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8981em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，方法按是否需 CAD、是否逐物体训练分为实例级、类别级、CAD 引导、零样本四类。</li>\n<li>传统配准用 FPFH 特征对应加 ICP，旋转有 SVD 闭式解，但对遮挡和对称物体脆弱。</li>\n<li>PoseCNN/PVNet 是实例级深度方法，NOCS 用归一化坐标空间实现类别级泛化，对称歧义用对称感知损失处理。</li>\n<li>2024–2026 基础模型驱动零样本：FoundationPose 成为通用基线，SAM-6D、FreePose 实现无 CAD 零样本，ActivePose 用主动视觉把成功率推到 90%。</li>\n<li>位姿估计适合已知物体的精确放置，与<a href=\"grasp-detection-networks\">抓取检测网络</a>的未知物体直接抓取互补，输出供<a href=\"../planning-control/kinematics-ik\">运动学与逆运动学</a>求解执行。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"6D 物体位姿估计","id":"6d-物体位姿估计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"传统配准与对应点方法","id":"传统配准与对应点方法"},{"level":2,"text":"深度学习的实例级与类别级方法","id":"深度学习的实例级与类别级方法"},{"level":2,"text":"基础模型驱动的零样本位姿","id":"基础模型驱动的零样本位姿"},{"level":2,"text":"位姿估计在抓取管线中的角色","id":"位姿估计在抓取管线中的角色"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"RGB-D 与点云处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/perception-pose/rgbd-pointcloud"},"next":{"title":"抓取检测网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/perception-pose/grasp-detection-networks"}}